{"title":"2020 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The five numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/c/08c9ced9a9e8913a179ab4771cf4614209b47d96.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{4}, \\frac{4}{10}, \\frac{41}{100}, 0.04, 0.404$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"174\" height=\"38\" /> are to be listed from smallest to largest. Which number will be in the middle of the list?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We see <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/7/4a78a5f8c787e11071ad2b95adbbc1a9e17bdf36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{4} = 0.25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"71\" height=\"38\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/b/1fb5a7bf1057809e8e4e80ac9b890ce69a0e3d21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4}{10} = 0.4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"71\" height=\"38\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/5/8e560a6e3f459007f7607b1b77c89e09d87f9fa5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{41}{100} = 0.41$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"90\" height=\"38\" />. Ordering everything from smallest to largest, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/9/a7910cb4e71686068c0d32f99cd0cdb19653ea9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.04, 0.25, 0.4, 0.404, 0.41$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"196\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Median\" title=\"Median\">median</a> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/2/532f79402cd2d051c7bde5d1c1a6ecce07e3bc2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"23\" height=\"13\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/a/9ea0a1caed21cb28ed38e724992c3b6198f9bcde.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\frac{4}{10}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"35\" height=\"49\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIMC\" title=\"2020 CIMC\">2020 CIMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CIMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CIMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2\" title=\"2020 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 2\">Part A Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Part A 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2\" title=\"2020 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 2\">Part A 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3\" title=\"2020 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 3\">Part A 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">Part A 4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Part A 5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Part A 6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">Part B 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Part B 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Part B 3</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Intermediate_Competition\" title=\"CEMC Intermediate Competition\">CEMC Intermediate Competition</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018062914\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.017 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.025 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 77/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1246/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 143/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20